      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-10-31T19:28:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That sounds fun.&nbsp; I don't see why you wouldn't be able to do it for Redeemer Fanatic, Rook City Wraith, and Beard Ra, as well.&nbsp; You couldn't really do it as well with Legacy, considering that they are clearly, um, different people.&nbsp;</p><p>There is the question about what you would do with the hit point totals.&nbsp; I think simply increasing and decreasing hit points by the proper amount every time the hero changes is the best solution.</p>",
