      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/uxm266/{size}/1966_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-01-10T19:46:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"j1hopki1\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> j1hopki1:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>UXM266,&nbsp;I love your signature. Also, other than HP I don't see any problems. I think it's easiest to just start at the lower HP. I'm working on a set of scenarios like the ones on Spiff's website, but that use all the current cards. I'd love to use this idea for one of the battles if you're okay with it. Thanks.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>First, Thanks for the complement on the quote. I love it too. It belongs to &gt;G though.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And about the gameplay, true, simply keeping your current HP makes sense. What i was thinking was that every turn that hero changes Promo cards. Keeps any Ongoings, and HP. Another way i was thinging was rolling a die or a coin flip. Make it random! 3 wraiths, well roll a die, get a random number generator. Something like that to make it even more random. And please, use it when you want or can. I just ahvnt thought of a good name. Maybe \"Paradigm Shift\" or \"Crisis of the Multiverses\".&nbsp;</p>",
