      "raw": "[quote=\"j1hopki1\"]\n\nUXM266,&nbsp;I love your signature. Also, other than HP I don&#39;t see any problems. I think it&#39;s easiest to just start at the lower HP. I&#39;m working on a set of scenarios like the ones on Spiff&#39;s website, but that use all the current cards. I&#39;d love to use this idea for one of the battles if you&#39;re okay with it. Thanks.\n\n[/quote]\n\nFirst, Thanks for the complement on the quote. I love it too. It belongs to &gt;G though.&nbsp;\n\nAnd about the gameplay, true, simply keeping your current HP makes sense. What i was thinking was that every turn that hero changes Promo cards. Keeps any Ongoings, and HP. Another way i was thinging was rolling a die or a coin flip. Make it random! 3 wraiths, well roll a die, get a random number generator. Something like that to make it even more random. And please, use it when you want or can. I just ahvnt thought of a good name. Maybe &quot;Paradigm Shift&quot; or &quot;Crisis of the Multiverses&quot;.&nbsp;\n",
